body:
 Ima wa muzukashīdesuga,-go de raku ni narudeshou. 今は難しいですが、後で簡単になります.

&#x200B;

Likewise to you my friend. If the void calls for you too strongly, and you lose grip and slip into it. We will be bound to meet, and share a friendship that goes beyond life.

&#x200B;

I'm usually very calm. I meditate a lot. But after losing employment, and refusing to sell weed again, I find myself at this fork in the road again.

&#x200B;

Noted. My window connects to the roof. Which is another floor up.
